  "verifiedBehavior": [
    "Ordinary ClientPacket::DropItem captures recursive existing ItemState; actual ZoneRuntime issues claim ticket; personal pickup followed by explicit Zone Commit removes the shared object.",
    "Normal LogOut persists the complete account file. A fresh config and Session normal Login/StartGame restore server-only functional fields and recursive socket state.",
    "12 present-invalid carrier variants refuse both preflight and commit, without inventory mutation; explicit Cancel retains shared source.",
    "Full inventory and nested UID collision refuse, preserving both custodians.",
    "Partial ordinary stack receives a distinct nonzero UID and keeps server fields; unsafe nested partial split refuses before removing inventory.",
    "Same UserItem wire with different server-only functional identity does not merge; outer display aliases do not overwrite full carrier names/descriptions.",
    "Existing death inventory/equipment penalty helpers capture state, and failed capture leaves sources untouched.",
    "None payload has old JSON bytes; synthesized old-shaped v1/v2/v3/v4 checkpoints restore and old-root injection of Some rejects.",
    "Private full bytes participate in Zone checkpoint roots and ZoneBase digest; internal JSON and MessagePack RPC retain them. Client view and spectator live/replay remove enclosing exactItem and private marker."
  ],
